<emu-clause id="sec-if-return-overview">
  <h1>if return overview</h1>
  <p>
    This document is a Stage 0 draft for a compact early-return statement form.
  </p>
  <p>
    Proposed statement form:
  </p>
  <emu-grammar type="definition">
    IfReturnStatement :
      if return Expression ;
  </emu-grammar>
  <p>
    Intended behavior is equivalent to evaluating the expression once and returning it when truthy.
  </p>
  <emu-alg>
    1. Let _v_ be the result of evaluating |Expression|.
    1. If ToBoolean(_v_) is *true*, return _v_.
    1. Return *empty*.
  </emu-alg>
</emu-clause>
